    gym_classes ||--o{ class_sessions : schedules
    members ||--o{ bookings : makes
    class_sessions ||--o{ bookings : receives
    bookings ||--o| attendance_records : produces
```

## Security and Privacy

Protect member information through authentication, role-based authorization, and appropriate data retention.

